## 📌 SOFTWARE ENGINEERING REQUIREMENT — WEEK 8

### Activity Diagram — Checkpoint and Configuration Validation

The workflow verifies that the selected model, configuration, and checkpoint are consistent before loading.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Select Model]
    B --> C[Find Model Configuration]
    C --> D{Configuration Available?}
    D -- No --> E[Correct Model Selection or Configuration]
    E --> C
    D -- Yes --> F[Determine Checkpoint Filename]
    F --> G{Checkpoint Available?}
    G -- No --> H[Download Checkpoint]
    H --> I[Load Checkpoint]
    G -- Yes --> I
    I --> J[Load Model Components]
    J --> K([Ready for Inference])
```